    "base_commit": "99bb0df9a481f550b0623722a999c6e8775e6a02",
    "scope": "Default extended final-head callback on the existing response capture owner. Borrow parser-owned ordered regular fields and reason bytes before completion; preserve old head/data implementations, validation, framing, DATA, cancellation and terminal ownership. No HeaderMap reconstruction.",
